Scope
-----

This license covers the original Go implementation, the independently authored
C sources under `runtime/`, build and packaging tooling, tests, and
documentation in this module.

It does **not** cover, and grants no rights to:

- Retail/manual/cover media under `internal/buildgui/assets/`, or any other
  third-party game artwork. The Go code which embeds or serves those files is
  covered; the media itself is not relicensed.
- A game ROM, generated/recompiled ROM code, extracted audio, or other content
  derived from a ROM. Those inputs and outputs remain subject to the rights in
  the original game and are not distributed by this module.
- Third-party components carrying their own license notices. Those notices
  continue to govern their respective components.

